{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295010","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1029501001:1":{"text":"あなたたち、そっちの方向から帰って来たってことは……本当に月の神殿で神の啓示を聞いてきたの？","source_cn":"你们从那个方向过来，难道说……你们真的去月神遗殿聆听神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB74FA233EA73279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029501002:1":{"text":"当然！ムーンストーンを先生に貸して、月の神殿の泉に投げ込んだわ。","source_cn":"当然！我把月光石借给老师，投入月神殿的泉眼内了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD524066E248CBC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"当然！ムーンストーンを先生に貸して、月の神殿の泉に投げ込んだわ。","female":"当然！ムーンストーンを先生に貸して、月の神殿の泉に投げ込んだわ。","variant_male_record_index":"115425","variant_female_record_index":"115426","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029501003:1":{"text":"もう、突っ走りすぎよ。まだこの伝説の考証も終ってないのに……","source_cn":"你也太莽撞了，我还没有做完这个传说的考证……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46EAA7200264528D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029501004:1":{"text":"滅多にないチャンスだもの、試してみなきゃ！","source_cn":"难得有机会当然要试验一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDABE7936A3216036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1029501004":{"text":"滅多にないチャンスだもの、試してみなきゃ！","source_cn":"难得有机会当然要试验一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDABE7936A3216036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029501005:1":{"text":"なら良かった。おかしなことが起きてなければいいわ。","source_cn":"那我就放心了，没有发生奇怪的事情就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD7BC59C2D2266CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029501006:1":{"text":"えっと……おかしなことなら……","source_cn":"呃……奇怪的事倒也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEA23F4DA96D5FBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029501007:1":{"text":"え？どうしたの？まさか……","source_cn":"嗯？怎么了，难道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69FDB2CC910A0F77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029501008:1":{"text":"ある意味、月の神の啓示を得ることはできなかった……","source_cn":"某种程度上来说，并没有成功获得月神的启示——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6CEA1E06004099E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029501009:1":{"text":"あぁ、やっぱり……","source_cn":"唉，果然如此……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0DD2EE60D95D086","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029501010:0":{"text":"でも、セレスチアルのサジタリス様に会えたの。","source_cn":"但我们见到了半神萨基塔里斯大人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5618E26F27B17C0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029501011:1":{"text":"何ですって！？ああ、セレスチアル様に直接聞けたなら、きっと様々な学術問題を検証できるのに！","source_cn":"什么？！那可是半神大人！一定有很多学术问题可以向他求证。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x719A41D5237B8B6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029501012:1":{"text":"セレスチアル様の魔力はどうだった？お姿は？手には長い矛を持っていたの？","source_cn":"半神大人的魔力是怎样的！半神大人样貌呢？他有手握长矛吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6739857EE6B03478","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029501013:1":{"text":"御年数百歳だって話だけど、私もこの目でお姿を崇めたかったなぁ……","source_cn":"据说他已经度过了几百年岁月，我也好想亲眼见证他的身姿啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78A4D185CE9297FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029501014:1":{"text":"でも、この伝説が多少なりとも現実に基づいているなら、もう一つの伝説も実証可能かもしれないわ。","source_cn":"不过，如果这个传说是有一定现实依据的话，另一个传说也有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3C32BAB60E4FAD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1029501015:1":{"text":"どう？興味ある？","source_cn":"你们有兴趣吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53B54B3076DEF750","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1029501015":{"text":"どう？興味ある？","source_cn":"你们有兴趣吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53B54B3076DEF750","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1029501016:1":{"text":"二つ目は、月の神殿には泉が二つ隠されていて、両方の泉を開放できれば、月の神の財宝が手に入るという伝説よ。","source_cn":"第二个传说是，月神遗殿隐藏着两个泉眼。如果能打开两处泉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x949EF584E9532AF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029501017:0":{"text":"泉の場所はもう調べてあるけど、開放の方法や、月の神の財宝が何なのかは分からないの。","source_cn":"泉眼的位置我已经确定了，但是具体如何开启以及月神的宝藏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3287C12F8A2369D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1029501018:0":{"text":"財宝には興味ないけど、神の財宝がどんな物かは気になるわ。だから頼んだわよ！","source_cn":"我对宝藏本身并不感兴趣，只想窥得何为神的宝藏。拜托你们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B7BED4445A5467F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"すごく興味がある。","source_cn":"很有兴趣","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8A5D24E75A344C58","variant_status":"runtime_gender_k